<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>로그인 - MGACE 연차관리</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="login-wrap">
    <div class="card login-card">
      <h1>MGACE 연차관리 시스템</h1>
      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/login">
        <div class="field">
          <label>이름</label>
          <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="홍길동" required>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>생년월일 (8자리)</label>
          <input type="text" name="birth_date" placeholder="19900101" maxlength="8" required>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" style="width:100%">로그인</button>
      </form>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:16px;text-align:center;">동명이인은 로그인 후 화면 상단 이름 옆 번호로 구분됩니다.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
